         fhir:comment [ fhir:v "Element `ObservationDefinition.description` has a context of ObservationDefinition based on following the parent source element upwards and mapping to `ObservationDefinition`.\nElement `ObservationDefinition.description` has no mapping targets in FHIR R4. Typically, this is because the element has been added (is a new element).\nThis description can be used to capture details such as comments about misuse, instructions for clinical use and interpretation, literature references, examples from the paper world, etc. It is not a rendering of the module as conveyed in the text field of the resource itself. This item SHOULD be populated unless the information is available from context." ]
